      "description": "A single-file, plugin-free custom CSS theme that gives the Jellyfin web client an iOS 26-style liquid glass look: aurora gradient backdrop, layered frosted panels, specular highlights and concentric corner radii. Version 4 fixes the playback overlay covering the video, and the theme also fixes Material Icons mojibake in Safari and WebViews.",
      "featureList": [
        "Aurora gradient background with four radial gradients over a deep-space linear base",
        "Frosted glass confined to floating layers (header, drawer, dialogs, login card, player controls)",
