        "iOS-style grouped inset lists on settings pages",
        "Responsive layouts for phone, tablet, foldable, desktop and TV",
        "Safe-area aware for notched devices",
        "Honours prefers-reduced-transparency, prefers-reduced-motion and prefers-contrast",
        "2178 explicit Material Icons glyph rules that fix icon mojibake in Safari and WebViews",
        "Playback overlay reworked into a floating control capsule that does not cover the video"
